            "review_title": "Review at Le Cottage",
            "review_text": "ronnikc\nOdense, Denmark14 contributions\n0\nNothing special\nJan 2015 • Solo\nMenu looks good but the food doesnt taste like its supposed on the contrary it seems bland borderlining meaningless.\n\nTried the Geen Pea Soup, that didnt taste of peas and the Fried Chicken with Garlic source which was a chicken drumstick with source that didnt taste of garlic and a servicing of rice on the side. Doesnt quite longer away from fried chicken with garlic source than that.\n\nThe place is fairly cheap though and its pretty nice but the food level is just fay off a western standard that the menu tries to sell.\nRead more\nWritten January 31, 2015",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-10",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
