            "review_title": "Review at Le Cottage",
            "review_text": "Trungquan\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\ndelicious food & romantic atmostphere!\nApr 2014 • Couples\nlast week, i visited this restaurant with my girlfriend. we were impressed with the decoration, so lovely. we order crepes and beefsteak. you can feel a french flavors in its. The price is very reasonable for a french style restaurant , the cheapest one in town which have visited. Service is also a good point. staffs are very nice. you don't have to wait too long for your orders. if you are looking for a French style restaurant in Ho Chi Minh city with romantic space, i suggest you to go there.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 21, 2014",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-10",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
