            "review_title": "Review at Le Cottage",
            "review_text": "Activetimes\nSaint Louis, Missouri1 contribution\n0\nEnjoyable little coffee shop!\nApr 2014\nA friend told me of the opening of this place, and I assumed it would be just like all the other café that I have been to. However, it was nice an cozy, and in fact reminded me of my grandmother's house. The food was pretty good too. I absolutely enjoyed the stuffed chicken thigh and the tropical sangria. The only downside was that the service was a bit slow, but Le Cottage is only a few days old, and while slow service is not desired... it is not unexpected. To the owners of Le Cottage; thank you for a pleasant experience.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 18, 2014",
            "rating": 5.0,
