            "review_text": "Yvonne G\nAnaheim, California1 contribution\n0\nvery good food, peaceful place with good music\nApr 2014 • Couples\nIt looked like they just opened the place a few places ago since they had grand opening sign. I tried the crepe with clementine sauce. The crepe was great, the sauce was outstanding. However since I was there on a busy Friday night so the service wasn't as good as I expected. The staff was busy but helpful and friendly. The decoration of the place is very unique. I spent a about 250k VND = $12 for 2 people with one main course and 2 crepes and tea. Not bad at all considering the location and the quality of the food.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 18, 2014",
            "rating": 5.0,
